<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Solar Project Quotation</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:24px;background-color:#f2f4f6;font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',Arial,sans-serif;color:#191c1e;">
  <div style="max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;background-color:#ffffff;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 6px 24px rgba(17,24,39,0.08);">
    <div style="padding:24px 32px;background-color:#ffffff;border-bottom:1px solid #eceef0;">
      <div style="font-size:28px;line-height:1.1;font-weight:800;color:#855300;letter-spacing:-0.03em;">Fordan Solar</div>
    </div>

    <div style="padding:40px 32px;background-color:#2d3133;">
      <p style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#ffddb8;">Quotation document</p>
      <h1 style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:32px;line-height:1.2;font-weight:800;color:#ffffff;">Your solar project quotation is ready.</h1>
      <p style="margin:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:rgba(239,241,243,0.84);">Hi {{customerName}}, we have finalized the saved proposal configuration for your project at {{projectAddress}}.</p>
    </div>

    <div style="padding:32px;">
      <p style="margin:0 0 28px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:#534434;">
        Thank you for choosing Fordan Solar. Below is the current quotation generated from your confirmed proposal configuration in our CRM.
      </p>

      <h2 style="margin:0 0 18px;font-size:22px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:800;color:#191c1e;">Project quotation breakdown</h2>

      <div style="margin:0 0 12px;padding:18px 20px;border-radius:16px;background-color:#f7f9fb;border:1px solid #eceef0;">
        <p style="margin:0 0 6px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#855300;">Project</p>
        <p style="margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:#191c1e;">
          <strong>Order:</strong> {{orderNumber}}<br>
          <strong>System type:</strong> {{systemTypeLabel}}<br>
          <strong>Solar array:</strong> {{systemSizeLabel}}<br>
          <strong>Battery storage:</strong> {{batterySizeLabel}}
        </p>
      </div>

      {{#each proposalItems}}
      <div style="margin:0 0 12px;padding:18px 20px;border-radius:16px;background-color:#f7f9fb;border:1px solid #eceef0;">
        <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;">
          <tr>
            <td style="vertical-align:top;padding-right:12px;">
              <p style="margin:0 0 6px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#855300;">Quoted item</p>
              <p style="margin:0 0 4px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4;font-weight:800;color:#191c1e;">{{label}}</p>
              {{#if subtitle}}
              <p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#534434;">{{subtitle}}</p>
              {{/if}}
            </td>
            <td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;">
              <p style="margin:0 0 6px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#855300;">Pricing</p>
              <p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#191c1e;">Qty {{quantity}}</p>
              <p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#191c1e;">Unit {{proposalUnitPrice}}</p>
              <p style="margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;font-weight:800;color:#191c1e;">{{lineTotal}}</p>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </div>
      {{/each}}

      <div style="margin:24px 0 28px;padding:22px 24px;border-radius:18px;background-color:#855300;">
        <p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#ffddb8;">Total project investment</p>
        <p style="margin:0;font-size:32px;line-height:1.1;font-weight:800;color:#ffffff;">{{proposalTotal}}</p>
      </div>

      <div style="padding:24px;border-radius:18px;background-color:rgba(213,224,248,0.3);">
        <h3 style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:800;color:#191c1e;">What happens next</h3>
        <p style="margin:0 0 10px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;color:#534434;">1. Review the quotation details and the attached PDF copy.</p>
        <p style="margin:0 0 10px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;color:#534434;">2. Reply to this email if you would like any changes to the equipment mix or pricing.</p>
        <p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;color:#534434;">3. Once approved, our team will guide you through contract signing and the next project milestones.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="padding:28px 32px;background-color:#f8fafc;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;text-align:center;">
      <div style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:22px;line-height:1.1;font-weight:800;color:#2d3133;">Fordan Solar</div>
      <p style="margin:0 0 6px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#9ca3af;">&copy; {{currentYear}} Fordan Solar. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p style="margin:0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#9ca3af;">This quotation email was generated from the saved proposal configuration in Fordan Solar CRM.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
